# The Civic Power Gap — Additional Resources

An optional, longer A4H-branded companion article for readers who want more context after visiting *Why A4H Matters to Our Families*.

## Public page

https://americans4hindus-mi.github.io/bhajanclubbing/civic-power-gap/

